@startuml sequence-progress-streak-m23
title SEQ-07: Progress & Daily Streak Tracking Flow (UC-07 / BF-13)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-14 Dashboard)" as Web
control "Streak Evaluator\n(Application Service)" as StreakSvc
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB

== 1. Qualifying Activity Trigger ==
note over Learner, Web
    Trigger: Learner completes a Qualifying Activity:
    - Complete Lesson (UC-05 / BF-10) OR
    - Complete SRS Review Session (UC-06 / BF-12)
    (App opens or passive views DO NOT qualify)
end note

Web -> StreakSvc: POST /api/learner/streak/evaluate
activate StreakSvc

StreakSvc -> DB: Query Profile (timezone, streak_count, last_qualifying_activity_date)\nWHERE id = auth.uid()
activate DB
DB --> StreakSvc: Return Profile data
deactivate DB

StreakSvc -> StreakSvc: Resolve local calendar date:\ncurrentDate = GetLocalDate(now(), Profile.timezone || "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh")

alt Case A: Already Qualified Today (currentDate == last_qualifying_activity_date)
    StreakSvc -> StreakSvc: Keep current streak_count (no duplicate increments)
    StreakSvc --> Web: 200 OK { streakCount: current, streakState: "MAINTAINED" }

else Case B: Consecutive Day Activity (currentDate == last_qualifying_activity_date + 1 day)
    StreakSvc -> StreakSvc: Increment streak_count = streak_count + 1
    StreakSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Profile" SET\n  streak_count = streak_count + 1,\n  last_qualifying_activity_date = currentDate\nWHERE id = auth.uid()
    activate DB
    DB --> StreakSvc: Profile updated
    deactivate DB
    StreakSvc --> Web: 200 OK { streakCount: newStreak, streakState: "INCREMENTED" }

else Case C: Missed Day / Broken Streak (currentDate > last_qualifying_activity_date + 1 day)
    StreakSvc -> StreakSvc: RESET streak_count = 1 (Decision D9)\n[NEVER reset to 0; no auto-freeze]
    note right of StreakSvc
        Policy D9 Invariant:
        - Streak Freeze and Recovery Power-Up are DEFERRED.
        - Missed calendar day resets streak strictly to 1.
        - No active freeze behavior exists in Core.
    end note
    StreakSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Profile" SET\n  streak_count = 1,\n  last_qualifying_activity_date = currentDate\nWHERE id = auth.uid()
    activate DB
    DB --> StreakSvc: Profile updated
    deactivate DB
    StreakSvc --> Web: 200 OK { streakCount: 1, streakState: "RESET_TO_1" }
end
deactivate StreakSvc

== 2. Dashboard Multidimensional Aggregation ==
Learner -> Web: View Personal Dashboard (SCR-L-14)
activate Web
Web -> DB: Query aggregated metrics for auth.uid():\n- LearningProgress (completedContentRatio)\n- SkillProfile (4 independent dimensions: Vocab, Grammar, Reading, Listening)\n- ConceptMastery (counts of MASTERED, DEVELOPING, NOVICE)\n- LevelReadiness (ADVANCE / ADVANCE_WITH_SUPPORT / REMEDIATE)\n- Profile.streakCount
activate DB
DB --> Web: Return user metrics payload
deactivate DB

Web --> Learner: Render Dashboard Display:\n- Flame Streak Counter (streakCount)\n- 4-Dimensional Skill Profile Spider/Radar Chart\n- Curriculum Progress Bar\n- Concept Mastery & Readiness Cards
deactivate Web

@enduml
